      en: ["The Taoyuan Free Trade Zone was officially opened in 2006.", "It is the first designated free trade zone established in Taiwan.", "The facility covers a total area of approximately 45 hectares.", "It is located directly adjacent to Taoyuan International Airport (TPE).", "The zone is a major hub for the global distribution of semiconductors.", "Businesses operating here enjoy significant tax exemptions and incentives."],
      es: ["Establecimiento: 2001.", "Superficie: unas 45 hectáreas.", "Número de empresas: más de 50.", "Empleados: unos 5.000.", "Ubicación: en el Aeropuerto Internacional de Taoyuan.", "Ventajas: exenciones fiscales, entorno libre de impuestos."],
