      en: ["The Linyuan Petrochemical Park was established during the 1970s.", "It is located in the Linyuan District of southern Kaohsiung.", "The state-owned CPC Corporation operates major refineries at this site.", "The park is a primary producer of ethylene for the global plastics industry.", "Its coastal position allows for the direct and efficient import of crude oil.", "Recent years have seen billions invested in modernizing production facilities."],
      es: ["Fundación: 1972.", "Superficie: unas 400 hectáreas.", "Número de empresas: varias docenas.", "Empleados: unos 10.000.", "Instalaciones: craqueador de nafta, fábricas de resina sintética.", "Cercanía al puerto de Kaohsiung."],
