      en: ["The Mingtan Power Plant was officially commissioned in the year 1995.", "It has a total installed capacity of approximately 1,600 megawatts.", "Sun Moon Lake functions as the facility's upper water reservoir.", "Most of the plant's machinery is located in massive underground caverns.", "The elevation head between the reservoirs is approximately 380 meters.", "It ranks as one of the largest pumped-storage power stations in Asia."],
